; Pure photos: EXIF reading (exif), the preview size (preview_size), JPEG
; segments (jpeg), Google Drive's requests and programs (drive), the
; originals' queue decisions (upload_queue) and the weekly Drive health check
; (health). No Brr, no
; store: the libraries below enforce it, and test/photos links this library
; natively. The Brr side is app/photos_io/.
(library
 (name herbier_photos)
 (public_name herbier.photos)
 (libraries herbier_domain herbier_net yojson ptime)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_deriving.eq)))
